:"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-02-28T17:41:16Z","updated_at":"2025-03-06T22:42:19Z","closed_at":"2025-03-06T22:42:19Z","assignee":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n\nv4.4.rc2.mono.official [01545c995]\n\nThis error appeared after upgrading to 4.4rc2 from 4.3.  I was previously using the jolt physics add on.  \n\nThis error goes away if i switch to the godot physics engine instead.  It reappears if using jolt.  \n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.rc2.mono - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6603) - AMD Ryzen 7 3700X 8-Core Processor (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWith Jolt Physics enabled, when adding a static body as a child of a VehicleWheel3D I get a flood of quaternion errors:\n\n```\nE 0:00:01:120   get_quaternion: Basis [X: (1.0, 0.0, 0.0), Y: (0.0, 1.0, 0.0), Z: (0.0, 0.0, -1.0)] must be \nnormalized in order to be casted to a Quaternion. Use get_rotation_quaternion() or call orthonormalized() \nif the Basis contains linearly independent vectors.\n  <C++ Error>   Condition \"!is_rotation()\" is true. Returning: Quaternion()\n  <C++ Source>  core/math/basis.cpp:730 @ get_quaternion()\n```\n\nI can get rid of the errors if I move the StaticBody3D outside of the VehicleWheel3D.  I do expect it to work as before.  I prefer adding a staticBody3D as a child of VehicleWheel3D for organizations sake. \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Enable Jolt Physics under Project -> Project Settings -> Physics -> 3D -> Physics Engine\n2. Add a VehicleBody3D node with a collision mesh\n3. Add a VehicleWheel3D node\n4. Add a StaticBody3D node as a child of the VehicleWheel3D\n5. Launch the scene and a flood of quaternion errors should appear\n\nIncluding project as well.  Open the project and run.  \n\nThank you.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrpWheelStaticBodyChild.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19031403/mrpWheelStaticBodyChild.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103408/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103408/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}